---
// GitHub Pages serves one 404 page for every address, so it is in both languages.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Page not found · 找不到頁面">
  <h1>Page not found</h1>
  <p>
    That page does not exist, or it has moved. Try the <a href="/">home page</a> or the
    <a href="/blog/">blog</a>.
  </p>
  <h2 lang="zh-Hant-TW">找不到頁面</h2>
  <p lang="zh-Hant-TW">
    這個頁面不存在，或已經移到別的地方。你可以回到<a href="/zh/">首頁</a>或看看<a href="/zh/blog/">部落格</a>。
  </p>
</Base>
